00:00:10.100 --> 00:00:11.530
<i>What have I done wrong?!</i>

00:00:11.900 --> 00:00:12.870
<i>Tell me, Oscar!</i>

00:00:13.330 --> 00:00:15.630
<i>I never want to see your face again!</i>

00:00:15.630 --> 00:00:16.330
