00:00:22.290 --> 00:00:23.420
<i>Wait!</i>

00:00:24.110 --> 00:00:24.910
<i>Oscar.</i>

00:00:25.310 --> 00:00:26.630
<i>Oscar!</i>

00:00:26.630 --> 00:00:28.670
<i>OSCAR!</i>

00:00:41.630 --> 00:00:42.720
A dream...

