00:02:14.360 --> 00:02:19.910
episode

00:02:14.360 --> 00:02:19.910
"Oscar in My Heart"

00:02:28.170 --> 00:02:30.540
It's all right. I was just dreaming.

00:02:30.540 --> 00:02:34.240
Oscar rarely leaves
Lady Antoinette's side these days,

00:02:34.240 --> 00:02:37.010
so I've hardly seen her lately
and that's probably why.

00:02:37.010 --> 00:02:40.380
Somehow, I feel like I've been cast aside...

00:02:40.380 --> 00:02:42.610
Silly, isn't it? I know...

00:02:42.610 --> 00:02:45.080
Oscar is a noble and the
Commander of the Royal Guards.

00:02:45.880 --> 00:02:50.320
She'll continue to climb the ranks,
but I'll always be just a stablehand.

00:02:50.320 --> 00:02:55.090
Maybe assuming our childhood friendship
will last forever is just wishful thinking...

00:02:56.960 --> 00:02:57.890
Oscar.

00:02:59.930 --> 00:03:01.770
You spent the night here?

00:03:01.770 --> 00:03:03.760
If you get sick, I don't want to hear about it.

00:03:12.280 --> 00:03:15.340
<i>Oscar, am I no longer needed...?</i>

00:03:25.120 --> 00:03:27.360
My, how beautiful!

00:03:27.360 --> 00:03:28.930
Look, Fersen.

00:03:28.930 --> 00:03:32.400
Look at how it's sparkling from the morning dew.

00:03:32.400 --> 00:03:34.730
My, it really is wonderful.

00:03:34.730 --> 00:03:37.730
No wonder it caught Her Highness' attention.

00:03:38.340 --> 00:03:40.600
So beautiful...

00:03:42.110 --> 00:03:44.210
Your Highness, what are you doing?

00:03:44.210 --> 00:03:46.340
It would be terrible if you hurt yourself!

00:03:46.340 --> 00:03:47.790
Your precious fingers will...!

00:03:52.480 --> 00:03:53.420
Thank you.

00:03:53.420 --> 00:03:54.080
My pleasure.

00:04:02.660 --> 00:04:04.630
It truly is beautiful...

00:04:05.260 --> 00:04:08.640
Now, let us go to the
Jardin d'Amour next, Count Fersen.

00:04:08.640 --> 00:04:09.660
Yes.

00:04:14.610 --> 00:04:18.180
Count Fersen has really become
Lady Antoinette's favorite, hasn't he?

00:04:18.180 --> 00:04:22.080
It's all the more worrisome, because Lady
Antoinette doesn't conceal her emotions.

00:04:22.080 --> 00:04:23.610
I just hope nothing happens.

00:04:23.610 --> 00:04:28.250
When it comes to Lady Antoinette, you worry
about things that have yet to even happen.

00:04:28.250 --> 00:04:30.120
You're starting to sound like her nanny, Oscar.

00:04:34.160 --> 00:04:35.860
Is something wrong?

00:04:35.860 --> 00:04:37.250
You're acting strange today.

00:04:38.030 --> 00:04:39.210
It's nothing.

00:04:39.900 --> 00:04:42.330
Men shouldn't sigh like that.

00:04:49.510 --> 00:04:53.730
<i>Is Lady Antoinette the only thing
that's on Oscar's mind?</i>

00:05:18.050 --> 00:05:18.870
What?!

00:05:18.870 --> 00:05:19.900
A horse?!

00:05:19.900 --> 00:05:21.240
A good horse?!

00:05:21.240 --> 00:05:22.470
Th-That's absurd...!

00:05:22.470 --> 00:05:25.610
Absolutely not! What if
something were to happen?!

00:05:25.610 --> 00:05:27.890
Please behave yourself!

00:05:27.890 --> 00:05:30.150
Why can't I ride a horse?

00:05:30.150 --> 00:05:33.230
Why am I the only one who is told,
''not this, not that?''

00:05:33.520 --> 00:05:35.880
Please be more mindful about yourself!

00:05:36.720 --> 00:05:40.460
Imagine what would happen to France, if something
were to happen to the future Queen.

00:05:40.460 --> 00:05:42.030
His Highness would never—

00:05:42.030 --> 00:05:44.090
I mean, never allow such a thing either!

00:05:48.230 --> 00:05:50.430
It's slowly taking shape.

00:05:51.040 --> 00:05:52.500
Your Highness!

00:05:52.500 --> 00:05:55.110
Countess Noailles, one of these days,

00:05:55.110 --> 00:05:56.440
I'll be sure to present you with one, too.

00:05:56.440 --> 00:05:57.810
Your Highness!

00:05:57.810 --> 00:06:00.960
Please make it clear to her that she is
forbidden from doing such things!

00:06:01.410 --> 00:06:03.650
Otherwise, she'll become
even more unrestrained,

00:06:03.650 --> 00:06:06.120
and who knows what Her Highness
might ask for next...

00:06:06.120 --> 00:06:08.650
Now, now. Why not let her, Countess Noailles?

00:06:08.650 --> 00:06:10.020
Your Highness!

00:06:10.020 --> 00:06:12.990
Oscar will be with her and so will André.

00:06:12.990 --> 00:06:14.450
I mean, if it's just a little bit...

00:06:19.060 --> 00:06:22.020
Your Highness is too soft on Lady Antoinette!

00:06:22.020 --> 00:06:25.200
W-Well... that's...

00:06:31.510 --> 00:06:34.480
My, what a stunning horse.

00:06:34.480 --> 00:06:36.710
I hear it's a gift from His Highness.

00:06:36.710 --> 00:06:41.550
Her Highness can make the most
beautiful things in this world hers.

00:06:41.550 --> 00:06:42.750
She's so fortunate.

00:06:43.120 --> 00:06:45.290
Will that wild child Princess
really be able to ride a horse?

00:06:45.290 --> 00:06:48.780
They're both wild, so they'll be
a good match. I'll bet 5000.

00:06:49.480 --> 00:06:52.430
Then, I'll bet 5000 that she falls from her horse.

00:06:52.430 --> 00:06:53.640
Oh, she's getting on the horse!

00:06:55.060 --> 00:06:56.970
Wow, it's so high up here!

00:06:56.970 --> 00:06:58.730
How wonderful!

00:06:58.730 --> 00:07:00.170
Please hold the reins.

00:07:00.170 --> 00:07:01.030
Please hold them tight.

00:07:01.540 --> 00:07:04.870
My, His Highness, Count Mercy
and Oscar, too...!

00:07:04.870 --> 00:07:06.990
Everyone looks so small!

00:07:07.640 --> 00:07:08.610
Your Highness!

00:07:08.610 --> 00:07:10.780
Please don't move around like that!

00:07:11.680 --> 00:07:13.030
I'm fine!

00:07:14.950 --> 00:07:17.000
Oh! It moved!

00:07:17.000 --> 00:07:18.880
Your Highness, please keep your voice down!

00:07:19.550 --> 00:07:21.520
Please hold the reins low.

00:07:21.520 --> 00:07:23.340
To stop, you must pull hard on the reins.

00:07:24.290 --> 00:07:25.990
Thank you, Oscar.

00:07:25.990 --> 00:07:28.220
Also, you mustn't kick the horse's sides.

00:07:29.460 --> 00:07:30.680
Thank you, André.

00:07:31.570 --> 00:07:33.680
Your Highness, you mustn't let go of the reigns!

00:07:34.800 --> 00:07:35.390
Watch out!

00:07:36.240 --> 00:07:37.230
Shoot!

00:07:46.780 --> 00:07:47.810
Your Highness!

00:07:48.520 --> 00:07:50.280
S-Someone...!

00:07:53.490 --> 00:07:54.390
Your Highness!

00:07:58.870 --> 00:08:00.900
André, let go of the reins!

00:08:00.900 --> 00:08:01.830
You'll be killed!

00:08:03.030 --> 00:08:05.020
<i>I'll never let go!</i>

00:08:20.140 --> 00:08:22.060
Lady Antoinette!

00:08:24.650 --> 00:08:26.520
Help! Help me!

00:08:26.850 --> 00:08:29.520
Your Highness, please don't let go of the reins!

00:08:44.270 --> 00:08:46.260
<i>At this pace, she'll be thrown into the canal!</i>

00:08:59.060 --> 00:09:01.820
O-Oscar! Help me!

00:09:06.190 --> 00:09:09.270
Your Highness, please lean your body
away from the horse's neck!

00:09:09.270 --> 00:09:10.860
No! I can't!

00:09:11.370 --> 00:09:14.770
Your Highness, please have courage! Please!

00:09:15.300 --> 00:09:16.620
It's impossible!

00:09:16.620 --> 00:09:18.370
Please believe in me!

00:09:18.370 --> 00:09:19.740
Your Highness, please hurry!

00:09:19.740 --> 00:09:20.370
Now!

00:09:39.260 --> 00:09:42.350
Your Highness, wake up! Please wake up!

00:09:43.360 --> 00:09:44.230
Your Highness...!

00:10:11.330 --> 00:10:13.590
Has the doctor arrived yet?!

00:10:13.590 --> 00:10:14.550
This is awful!

00:10:14.930 --> 00:10:17.160
As you can see, she's still unconscious...

00:10:24.370 --> 00:10:27.340
<i>Please, Your Highness... Please wake up!</i>

00:10:34.520 --> 00:10:37.250
Who is the stablehand responsible
for this incident?!

00:10:37.250 --> 00:10:39.120
Arrest him immediately!

00:10:40.490 --> 00:10:41.620
What?!

00:10:41.620 --> 00:10:43.220
André was arrested?!

00:10:43.220 --> 00:10:44.330
Don't say such nonsense!

00:10:44.860 --> 00:10:46.690
I-It's true, Commander!

00:10:46.690 --> 00:10:48.250
Just now, he was taken away!

00:10:51.530 --> 00:10:53.230
André was arrested...

00:10:53.230 --> 00:10:54.900
That can't... That can't be!

00:11:05.550 --> 00:11:09.020
Your responsibility for causing such
a grievous incident is grave!

00:11:09.020 --> 00:11:10.810
Are you prepared to face the consequences?

00:11:12.810 --> 00:11:15.620
You have caused the Dauphine to be injured!

00:11:15.620 --> 00:11:18.720
It may have been accidental,
but you will not escape execution!

00:11:33.090 --> 00:11:35.990
<i>André, I won't let you die!</i>

00:11:36.560 --> 00:11:38.550
<i>I'll never let them execute you!</i>

00:11:51.160 --> 00:11:52.730
Take him away to prison at once!

00:12:02.170 --> 00:12:03.370
Please wait!

00:12:05.810 --> 00:12:06.580
Oscar!

00:12:19.890 --> 00:12:22.470
Your Majesty, please... Please wait!

00:12:28.500 --> 00:12:29.400
Your Highness,

00:12:30.000 --> 00:12:31.330
Countess Noailles,

00:12:32.370 --> 00:12:33.460
Count Mercy,

00:12:34.340 --> 00:12:35.440
Count Fersen,

00:12:35.440 --> 00:12:36.860
and everyone else who was there...

00:12:37.200 --> 00:12:39.110
They all saw what happened!

00:12:39.110 --> 00:12:41.840
It was a careless mistake,
but André is not at fault!

00:12:46.750 --> 00:12:47.410
Oscar!

00:12:51.120 --> 00:12:54.050
If you must punish André...

00:12:56.160 --> 00:12:58.130
In the name of the House of Jarjayes,

00:13:00.660 --> 00:13:03.000
I request a formal trial!

00:13:03.000 --> 00:13:04.290
If a trial won't be granted,

00:13:05.090 --> 00:13:08.170
as André's master, André's responsibilities are mine, as well!

00:13:08.170 --> 00:13:08.810
Please...

00:13:10.810 --> 00:13:14.870
... take my, Oscar François' life first!

00:13:17.690 --> 00:13:19.110
Oscar...

00:13:22.080 --> 00:13:22.880
Your Majesty!

00:13:25.360 --> 00:13:30.000
Your Majesty, I, Axel von Fersen request the same.

00:13:31.030 --> 00:13:32.450
<i>Count Fersen!</i>

00:13:32.790 --> 00:13:35.730
Your Majesty, the fault does not lie with André!

00:13:35.730 --> 00:13:38.860
If you insist, please take my life, as well.

00:13:40.530 --> 00:13:43.940
<i>Such an extraordinary man... Axel von Fersen!</i>

00:13:43.940 --> 00:13:46.300
<i>He's a man with an incredible sense of justice!</i>

00:13:46.970 --> 00:13:48.220
Your Majesty!

00:13:49.010 --> 00:13:51.970
Please! Please do not punish anyone!

00:13:54.550 --> 00:13:56.750
I, Antoinette, am the one who is at fault!

00:13:56.750 --> 00:13:58.070
This all stems from my selfishness!

00:13:58.890 --> 00:13:59.980
<i>Lady Antoinette!</i>

00:14:04.490 --> 00:14:06.460
André, Oscar, Fersen!

00:14:06.460 --> 00:14:09.370
It's all right! His Majesty
is a merciful person!

00:14:11.130 --> 00:14:14.290
To think that even one of you should die for me...

00:14:14.740 --> 00:14:16.200
No one is to blame!

00:14:16.200 --> 00:14:18.420
Excuse yourselves! Hurry on! Hurry!

00:14:26.310 --> 00:14:27.210
Very well.

00:14:27.210 --> 00:14:29.550
If the Dauphine insists,

00:14:30.040 --> 00:14:33.980
I will not punish anyone for this incident.

00:14:34.520 --> 00:14:37.440
André, you have a good master.

00:14:39.030 --> 00:14:39.990
Your Majesty!

00:14:50.320 --> 00:14:53.170
<i>Count Fersen, I thank you with all my heart.</i>

00:14:53.170 --> 00:14:56.410
<i>I will never... never forget
that I am in your debt!</i>

00:15:02.650 --> 00:15:03.210
Oscar!

00:15:10.090 --> 00:15:11.090
Oscar!

00:15:11.690 --> 00:15:12.430
Oscar!

00:15:14.930 --> 00:15:16.080
Blood...

00:15:54.180 --> 00:15:59.140
God, please save Lady Oscar's life.

00:15:59.140 --> 00:16:02.580
Please have mercy. God, please...!

00:16:02.580 --> 00:16:03.700
This way.

00:16:05.450 --> 00:16:07.170
Doctor, please!

00:16:07.170 --> 00:16:08.410
Please save her!

00:16:09.420 --> 00:16:11.460
S-She'll survive, won't she?!

00:16:11.460 --> 00:16:13.990
Oscar will recover from this, won't she?!

00:16:14.420 --> 00:16:17.520
Well, I can't say without examining her first.

00:16:20.960 --> 00:16:24.530
If only I had paid closer attention,
this never would have happened...

00:16:24.530 --> 00:16:26.900
It's my fault Oscar got injured...!

00:16:28.050 --> 00:16:29.640
It's all my fault!

00:16:31.870 --> 00:16:33.130
Calm down, André.

00:16:33.940 --> 00:16:37.270
Oscar, that injury should have been mine!

00:16:37.650 --> 00:16:39.010
André, calm down!

00:16:39.010 --> 00:16:40.230
I understand how you feel.

00:16:40.230 --> 00:16:42.610
Listen, it's about Oscar's wound now.

00:16:44.080 --> 00:16:46.320
Could you undo the shirt for me, please?

00:16:46.320 --> 00:16:48.150
Y-Yes...

00:16:50.590 --> 00:16:53.950
André, take Lord Fersen and go outside.

00:16:54.600 --> 00:16:56.230
Oh, right...

00:16:56.230 --> 00:16:57.160
Wh-What is it?

00:16:57.160 --> 00:16:59.730
Why the sudden formalities now?
What is the problem?

00:17:00.370 --> 00:17:02.870
Display of skin amongst men isn't allowed?

00:17:03.470 --> 00:17:04.790
What are we, royalty?

00:17:04.790 --> 00:17:06.670
Wh-What did you say?!

00:17:06.670 --> 00:17:09.610
How dare you say such a thing about our Lady?!

00:17:09.610 --> 00:17:10.630
Lady?!

00:17:10.630 --> 00:17:12.590
H-Hurry up and get out!

00:17:20.490 --> 00:17:22.730
Oscar is a woman...!

00:17:23.690 --> 00:17:26.270
Oscar isn't a woman, but a man!

00:17:27.230 --> 00:17:28.960
What? But just now...

00:17:28.960 --> 00:17:32.770
Oscar was raised as a man and lived as a man.

00:17:32.770 --> 00:17:33.730
From here on, as well!

00:17:34.440 --> 00:17:36.950
<i>It's no wonder she's so slender...</i>

00:17:43.180 --> 00:17:46.960
<i>She looks so delicate and fragile, yet...</i>

00:17:46.960 --> 00:17:48.520
<i>What an extraordinary woman!</i>

00:17:48.520 --> 00:17:51.610
<i>Oscar, you are more of a man than most men.</i>

00:18:18.710 --> 00:18:19.580
Oscar!

00:18:22.480 --> 00:18:23.510
Oscar...

00:18:24.120 --> 00:18:26.040
What is Oscar's condition?

00:18:26.040 --> 00:18:27.650
Yes, well...

00:18:27.650 --> 00:18:30.520
All in all, she lost a lot of blood from her wound.

00:18:30.520 --> 00:18:33.460
Furthermore, her bruises are rather severe.

00:18:33.460 --> 00:18:37.220
It's because she fell from her horse
while holding Lady Antoinette...

00:18:38.630 --> 00:18:39.930
Tell me she will be all right!

00:18:39.930 --> 00:18:41.200
Yes, General.

00:18:41.200 --> 00:18:44.640
I believe once she regains consciousness,
there shouldn't be any reason for concern.

00:18:44.640 --> 00:18:46.110
However, she's still...

00:18:47.140 --> 00:18:48.870
Tonight will be crucial.

00:18:50.210 --> 00:18:52.110
Tonight will be crucial...

00:18:52.980 --> 00:18:54.970
Tonight will be crucial...

00:18:56.280 --> 00:18:58.090
Oscar, I heard what happened!

00:18:58.090 --> 00:19:00.160
Everyone was singing their praises about you!

00:19:00.450 --> 00:19:02.060
I am so proud...!

00:19:02.060 --> 00:19:03.120
Oscar...

00:19:03.420 --> 00:19:06.080
You are truly my son!

00:19:20.510 --> 00:19:22.970
<i>Oscar, please wake up!</i>

00:19:23.810 --> 00:19:26.470
<i>Oscar, please open your eyes!</i>

00:19:28.720 --> 00:19:30.080
<i>I'm ashamed...</i>

00:19:30.850 --> 00:19:35.080
<i>I'm ashamed of myself for doubting
your feelings, even for a moment!</i>

00:19:52.610 --> 00:19:53.420
<i>Oscar...</i>

00:19:54.980 --> 00:19:57.380
<i>You haven't changed one bit.</i>

00:19:58.410 --> 00:20:01.070
<i>You're still the same Oscar
as when we were young.</i>

00:20:03.450 --> 00:20:05.150
André, this is for you.

00:20:05.750 --> 00:20:08.690
This is...
The Master's sword from his youth...

00:20:08.690 --> 00:20:10.110
It's been in your family for generations!

00:20:10.490 --> 00:20:14.550
Father gave me two, so you and I both get one!

00:20:15.100 --> 00:20:16.030
Oscar!

00:20:16.430 --> 00:20:17.860
Now, prepare yourself!

00:20:18.770 --> 00:20:19.530
Come at me!

00:20:26.200 --> 00:20:27.510
Come on, faster!

00:20:27.510 --> 00:20:28.200
All right!

00:20:32.670 --> 00:20:34.110
Oscar!

00:20:35.050 --> 00:20:36.640
Oscar!

00:20:37.420 --> 00:20:38.280
Oscar!

00:20:38.920 --> 00:20:39.910
Oscar!

00:20:41.260 --> 00:20:43.090
Oscar! You're awake!

00:20:44.960 --> 00:20:45.640
André...

00:20:47.230 --> 00:20:48.970
Oscar! Thank goodness!

00:20:50.730 --> 00:20:52.370
Lady Oscar!

00:20:52.370 --> 00:20:56.560
Thank goodness...
Thank goodness you're all right...

00:20:59.570 --> 00:21:01.970
I had a dream of when we were young.

00:21:02.480 --> 00:21:05.330
You were calling my name, almost in tears...

00:21:05.880 --> 00:21:06.970
Oscar...!

00:21:14.020 --> 00:21:16.460
Fersen, thank you for coming
at such an early hour.

00:21:16.460 --> 00:21:18.390
Well, well. Now I can breathe a little easier.

00:21:18.390 --> 00:21:19.970
You had me worried for a bit.

00:21:20.730 --> 00:21:22.300
I'm sorry to have made you worry.

00:21:22.900 --> 00:21:24.260
You sure are lucky!

00:21:25.930 --> 00:21:27.230
By the way, where is my mother?

00:21:27.700 --> 00:21:30.810
Madame is caring for Lady Antoinette.

00:21:31.210 --> 00:21:34.770
Lady Antoinette is feeling so well,
I hear she went for a walk this morning.

00:21:35.340 --> 00:21:37.240
I see. Thank goodness.

00:21:38.650 --> 00:21:40.730
I also made you worry, didn't I, André?

00:21:43.880 --> 00:21:45.420
Thank goodness though.

00:21:45.420 --> 00:21:49.180
You're probably the only person ever to still
have their head after injuring a royal, André.

00:21:51.890 --> 00:21:54.360
<i>Oscar, you're such a...</i>

00:21:56.230 --> 00:21:59.000
<i>Someday, I'll give up my life for you...</i>

00:21:59.870 --> 00:22:03.970
<i>Just as you risked yours for me yesterday!</i>

00:22:08.640 --> 00:22:09.970
<i>Someday...</i>

00:22:09.970 --> 00:22:12.100
<i>Someday, I, André, will...</i>

00:22:12.550 --> 00:22:14.240
<i>I will give my life!</i>

00:22:15.320 --> 00:22:17.100
<i>I will give my life!</i>

00:22:18.290 --> 00:22:19.770
<i>I will give my life!</i>

